<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine Banking Q1 net 59 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Philippine Banking Q1 net 59 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine Banking Corp said on Wednesday it posted net income of 59.116 million pesos in the first three months of the year.</p>
<p>In a disclosure to the Philippine Stock Exchange, the bank said its interest income from January to March reached 338.94 million pesos.</p>
<p>The company did not give comparative figures.</p>
<p>--MANILA NEWSROOM (63 2) 841-8936, FAX 817-6267</p>
</text>
